<view class="page"><view class="privacy-hero"><text class="lock">▣</text><text class="title">你的记录，由你掌控</text><text class="subtitle">私人正文默认仅在本人账号中展示。</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在加载…</view><block wx:else><view class="card row"><view><text class="item-title">AI 使用权限</text><text class="subtitle">由管理员在管理端统一设置；当前{{info.aiConsent ? '已授权' : '未授权'}}。</text></view><text class="muted readonly">只读</text></view><view class="card row"><view><text class="item-title">跟读录音云端保存</text><text class="subtitle">开启后录音私密上传至 OSS；关闭后停止上传，已保存录音可在短文页删除。</text></view><switch checked="{{info.followRecordingConsent}}" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#0869f7" bindchange="toggleFollowRecording"/></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view><text class="item-title">导出我的数据</text><text class="subtitle">包含本人文本与 JSON 数据。</text></view><button class="secondary small" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="requestExport">申请导出</button></view><text wx:if="{{info.exportState}}" class="status">当前状态：{{info.exportState}}</text></view><view class="card"><text class="item-title">删除进度</text><text class="subtitle">{{info.deletionState?('当前状态：'+info.deletionState):'尚未提交账号清理任务'}}</text></view><view class="card danger-card"><view class="row"><view><text class="danger-title">注销账号</text><text class="subtitle">将删除账号及关联私人数据，无法恢复。</text></view><button class="danger small" bindtap="deleteAccount">注销账号</button></view></view><text class="privacy-link">隐私说明 ›</text><text class="foot">跟读录音仅本人可访问；AI 使用需由管理员授权。</text></block></view>
